    "body": "I'll pull it out to top-level:\r\n\r\n```diff\r\n+  <p class=\"note\">Steps running <span>in parallel</span> can themselves run other steps in <span>in\r\n+  parallel</span>.</p>\r\n```\r\n\r\nI think this note should say something about what this accomplishes. E.g. \"This is useful when running steps inside a [parallel queue], to run a new set of non-queued steps.\"",
